{
  "id": "ep044",
  "duration": 50.652,
  "beats": [
    {
      "start": 0.08,
      "end": 5.223,
      "text": "One Soviet officer prevented a nuclear war by ignoring a missile warning.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "2023 Warszawa Ogr\u00f3d Sprawiedliwych, Stanis\u0142aw Jewgrafowicz Pietrow.jpg",
        "credit": "Cybularny",
        "license": "CC0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2023_Warszawa_Ogr%C3%B3d_Sprawiedliwych,_Stanis%C5%82aw_Jewgrafowicz_Pietrow.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 2.033,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 2.033,
          "end": 5.233,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 5.223,
      "end": 14.018,
      "text": "On September 26, 1983, Lieutenant Colonel Stanislav Petrov sat at his console in a secret bunker near Moscow.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Launch the nukes ! (51425478331).jpg",
        "credit": "Mike McBey",
        "license": "CC BY 2.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Launch_the_nukes_!_(51425478331).jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 5.233,
          "end": 9.333,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 9.333,
          "end": 14.033,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 14.018,
      "end": 20.663,
      "text": "The early warning computer system reported four additional incoming missiles shortly after the first.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "FP2A8708 (37296933972).jpg",
        "credit": "\u041c\u0443\u0437\u0435\u0439 \u041a\u043e\u0441\u043c\u043e\u043d\u0430\u0432\u0442\u0438\u043a\u0438 from \u0420\u043e\u0441\u0441\u0438\u044f",
        "license": "CC0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:FP2A8708_(37296933972).jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 14.033,
          "end": 20.667,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 20.663,
      "end": 27.133,
      "text": "Soviet military protocol demanded an immediate counterattack upon receiving such a warning.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Atlas-B ICBM.jpg",
        "credit": "USAF",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Atlas-B_ICBM.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 20.667,
          "end": 27.133,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 27.133,
      "end": 35.483,
      "text": "Petrov reasoned that a real US first strike would involve a massive onslaught of hundreds of missiles rather than just five.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "US Army tanks face off against Soviet tanks, Berlin 1961.jpg",
        "credit": "U.S. Army photo\nPhoto Credit: USAMHI",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:US_Army_tanks_face_off_against_Soviet_tanks,_Berlin_1961.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 27.133,
          "end": 31.967,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 31.967,
          "end": 35.467,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 35.483,
      "end": 42.978,
      "text": "Subsequent investigation determined the false alarm was caused by sunlight reflecting off high-altitude clouds.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Ash Plume over Australia (MODIS 2022-01-19).jpg",
        "credit": "MODIS Land Rapid Response Team, NASA GSFC",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ash_Plume_over_Australia_(MODIS_2022-01-19).jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 35.467,
          "end": 38.1,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 38.1,
          "end": 42.967,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 42.978,
      "end": 50.302,
      "text": "By treating the warning as a malfunction instead of reporting an attack, one Soviet officer prevented a nuclear war.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "2023 Warszawa Ogr\u00f3d Sprawiedliwych, Stanis\u0142aw Jewgrafowicz Pietrow.jpg",
        "credit": "Cybularny",
        "license": "CC0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2023_Warszawa_Ogr%C3%B3d_Sprawiedliwych,_Stanis%C5%82aw_Jewgrafowicz_Pietrow.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 42.967,
          "end": 50.667,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
